{
  "name": "Checkpoint Weekly Video Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0001",
      "name": "Her Gün 07:00"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://render-server:3456/weekly",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 7200000
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0002",
      "name": "1 Video Render Et"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nif (item.exitCode !== 0) {\n  throw new Error('weekly-generate.mjs hata ile çıktı. Log: /tmp/weekly-render.log');\n}\nconst stdout = (item.stdout || '').trim();\nconst jsonLine = stdout.split('\\n').find(l => l.startsWith('{'));\nconst result = JSON.parse(jsonLine);\nreturn [{ json: result }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0003",
      "name": "Render Sonucu Kontrol"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://render-server:3456/publish",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 600000
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0004",
      "name": "Buffer'a Schedule Et"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst stdout = (item.stdout || '').trim();\nconst jsonLine = stdout.split('\\n').find(l => l.startsWith('{'));\nlet summary;\ntry { summary = JSON.parse(jsonLine); } catch(e) { summary = { raw: stdout }; }\nconst failed = (summary.summary || []).filter(s => s.error || s.hasError).length;\nconst success = item.exitCode === 0 && failed === 0;\nreturn [{ json: { ...summary, exitCode: item.exitCode, failed, success } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0005",
      "name": "Publish Sonucu Kontrol"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "success-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ww-0006",
      "name": "Başarılı mı?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Başarılı\n\nHer Pazar 03:00'da çalışır:\n1. Groq ile 7 farklı script üretilir\n2. Remotion ile 7 video render edilir (~1-2 saat)\n3. Cloudflare R2'ye yüklenir\n4. YouTube, TikTok, Instagram'a 14:00 UTC'de yayınlanmak üzere Buffer'a schedule edilir\n\nLog dosyaları:\n- Render: /tmp/weekly-render.log\n- Publish: /tmp/weekly-publish.log",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        100
      ],
      "id": "ww-0007",
      "name": "Başarı Notu"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ❌ Hata\n\nBuraya bildirim ekle:\n- Slack node\n- Email node\n- Discord webhook\n\nHata detayı: {{ $json }}",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 300
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        460
      ],
      "id": "ww-0008",
      "name": "Hata Notu"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Kurulum\n\n### n8n'i kur (henüz yoksa)\n```\nnpm install -g n8n\nn8n start\n```\nAdresi: http://localhost:5678\n\n### Bu workflow'u içe aktar\n1. n8n aç → Workflows → Import\n2. Bu dosyayı seç: `n8n/workflow-weekly.json`\n3. Aktif et (toggle)\n\n### Önemli ayarlar\n- Execute Command node timeout'u artır:\n  n8n Settings → `EXECUTIONS_TIMEOUT` = 14400 (4 saat)\n  veya `.env` dosyasına ekle: `EXECUTIONS_TIMEOUT=14400`\n\n### Manuel test\n```\n# Önce dry-run\nnpm run weekly:dry\n\n# Gerçek render (uzun sürer)\nnpm run weekly\n\n# Buffer'a gönder\nnpm run publish\n```",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ww-0009",
      "name": "Kurulum Rehberi"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Her Pazartesi 10:30": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "1 Video Render Et",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Render Sonucu Kontrol": {
      "main": [
